Content (CHARTED — Will's direction, main chat, 2026-11-24 15:38 CST):
inky — the writing tool assistant that shipped today to wbic16/inky (commit 0a1e1e56) — ported to Android.

The engine is one self-contained stdlib Python file (inky.py) of pure text logic: move generation, a feature evaluation (lexicon fit + structure fit), beam search over the sentence, tiers. No services, no state — it ports cleanly in principle.

Product shape: a keyboard (IME). A writing assistant belongs where writing happens.

Rungs, as estimated in the main chat 2026-11-24 15:36 CST: the quick rung is a Chaquopy shell app (the existing Python engine running unmodified inside an Android shell), ~6-10 EE; the full rung is the engine ported to Kotlin as a keyboard, ~40-60 EE.

Hop-check on listing (charter hop rule, Will 2026-11-24 15:05 CST): REACHABLE — and shipped the same hour. The ranch hub (aletheia-core) already carries a full Android toolchain (JDK 21, Android SDK platform 34 + build-tools 34/35, Gradle 8.10.2), so the quick rung was built immediately: a Chaquopy 16.1.0 shell app (io.phext.inky, minSdk 26, targetSdk 34, debug-signed) wrapping the real engine unmodified — bundled inky.py sha256 b92cf2fbea517afffb1625d395073007312c4aee07efc0e29226c51e1a4167b4 matches the shipped source exactly; a thin runner drives it through its own CLI surface. Smoke test: planted typos corrected (teh/thier/freind/recieved class), the hippo form/from flagged in the analysis and NOT auto-fixed, scored lines shown with tiers. Shipped to wbic16/inky@exo commit 6b2aa6e as android/inky-android.apk (37,525,914 bytes, sha256 1a7c35d96c8cd2cde1c396658a6fd457b8f35f500e42ce11ffbffee1e9e4eb85), project sources beside it under android/, README section recording the rung. (A GitHub release asset was attempted first; the API helper cannot perform binary uploads to uploads.github.com, so the APK ships as a repo file.) The star stays charted as the full moonshot regardless: the Kotlin keyboard port is the moonshot; the Chaquopy shell is the reachable rung, now landed.
